1
00:00:09,199 --> 00:00:10,679
Here, let me fill your cup.

2
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,800
Come on.

3
00:00:17,199 --> 00:00:18,000
Come on.

4
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,440
