5
00:00:21,879 --> 00:00:23,000
Clear the way!

6
00:00:23,559 --> 00:00:24,039
Move!

7
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:27,359
Attack!

8
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,400
Holy Maiden.

9
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,200
