14
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,239
Do you still remember your mission?

15
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:49,439
What mission?

16
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:50,760
Should I know?

17
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:53,000
If I had known this,

18
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,280
I should have

19
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,680
