20
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,319
This woman

21
00:01:57,959 --> 00:01:59,359
looks a little scary.

22
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,519
Holy Maiden,

23
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:07,239
since you know my mission,

24
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,240
are you here to help me?

25
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,360
Of course.

26
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:11,960
In the past,

27
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,240
the Qinglou State and the Li State were at war.

28
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,199
After our country was defeated,

29
