35
00:02:28,039 --> 00:02:28,960
It's a pity that

36
00:02:29,439 --> 00:02:32,319
you disappeared after entering the palace.

37
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,800
We all thought

38
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,000
you had died in the palace.

39
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,240
So they sent you here

40
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,080
to finish the unfinished cause.

41
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:40,960
Exactly.

42
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,520
Oh, my.

43
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,719
[The original owner took the script of]

44
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:46,639
[a revengeful female lead]

45
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:48,159
[who caused chaos in the palace.]

46
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,120
Then why don't you

47
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,039
think about how to deal with the emperor,

48
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,159
but catch so many

49
00:02:53,159 --> 00:02:54,000
