What girls?

51
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:57,120
These are my medicine guides.

52
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:57,759
Medicine guides?

53
00:02:57,879 --> 00:02:58,280
Yes.

54
00:02:58,919 --> 00:03:01,039
These girls with pure yin

55
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,199
are all for me to

56
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,639
make the Heart of Poison.

57
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,439
Once the old emperor

58
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:07,120
takes the Heart of Poison,

59
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,439
I'll be able to control his mind.

60
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,000
The throne of the Li State

61
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,759
will be within my grasp.

62
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:14,800
Well,

63
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,879
I'm not sure

64
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:17,800
if I should say this.

65
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,120
I don't know if you've been

66
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,520
so focused on your alchemy

67
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:23,039
that you've lost track of current events.

68
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:24,800
The old emperor of the Li State

69
00:03:25,479 --> 00:03:26,159
