70
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:29,479
Controlling him won't do you much good.

71
00:03:31,479 --> 00:03:32,159
What did you say?

72
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:33,199
You mean

73
00:03:34,759 --> 00:03:36,159
all my efforts over the years

74
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:37,560
were in vain?

75
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,199
Exactly.

76
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:43,680
Never mind.

77
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:45,400
Never mind.

78
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:48,919
If the old emperor dies,

79
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:50,879
there's still the new emperor.

80
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,159
What did you say?

81
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,159
The elixir I make

82
00:03:53,599 --> 00:03:54,560
will have the same effect

83
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:55,879
