84
00:03:56,879 --> 00:03:57,560
I heard

85
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,919
the Crown Prince of Li Kingdom

86
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,599
is gentle.

87
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:02,000
This kind of person

88
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,360
is the easiest to manipulate.

89
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,840
The elixir is almost ready.

90
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:06,680
At that time,

91
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:09,080
