93
00:04:11,879 --> 00:04:12,479
That's it.

94
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,479
No way.

95
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,079
What did you say?

96
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:19,480
You dare to hurt my people.

97
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,439
You cunning woman.

98
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,279
You're always

99
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,279
plotting and scheming,

100
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,040
poisoning and backstabbing.

101
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:29,439
You shout slogans loudly,

102
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,720
but you don't even know

103
00:04:30,759 --> 00:04:31,480
the old emperor is dying.

104
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,680
How can you do intelligence work like this?

105
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:33,879
You still have the nerve to stir up trouble?

106
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:34,319
Ouch.

107
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,680
You want to bully the Crown Prince of Li State?

108
00:04:35,759 --> 00:04:36,680
You don't live a good life,

109
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:37,879
but make yourself

110
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,879
look like a monster.

111
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,800
Look at your hair.

112
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,639
You must have stayed up late.

113
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,519
You must be under too much pressure.

114
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:42,800
Your endocrine must be out of balance.

115
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,360
Go away!

116
00:04:49,439 --> 00:04:50,720
Are you really Feng Zhiwei?

117
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,240
As the Imperial Lady,

118
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,920
