119
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,560
Vulgar?

120
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:55,800
I'm teaching you

121
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,600
how to behave.

122
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,000
You use his medicine

123
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:58,680
without asking him

124
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,399
for permission.

125
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:02,399
I'll teach you a lesson.

126
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:04,519
Enough!

127
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,439
As the Holy Maiden,

128
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:09,279
you should behave yourself.

129
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,720
I think

130
00:05:11,079 --> 00:05:13,079
you've betrayed Qinglou State.

131
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:14,399
Fine.

132
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:15,720
Since you choose

133
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,920
to stand on the side of Li State,

134
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,800
how dare you hurt my people!

135
00:05:26,519 --> 00:05:27,279
You're asking for death!

136
00:05:29,879 --> 00:05:32,319
The Crown Prince of Li State, Gu Jiachen?

137
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:35,040
So you've been connected with

138
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:36,000
the Crown Prince of Li State.

139
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,439
He pursued me first.

140
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,959
I don't care who pursued whom.

141
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,279
Today,

142
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,480
I'll make you two

143
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,360
die here together.

144
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,319
How can there be

145
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:01,519
magic attacks

146
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:03,040
in this world?

147
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:09,279
I ate the magic mushroom.

148
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:11,800
Why is there disco music?

149
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,279
Feng Zhiwei,

150
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:37,600
