153
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,199
Put down your sword,

154
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:08,000
and let me accompany you.

155
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,319
Forget about the witch.

156
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,279
You want to hug me, don't you?

157
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:14,720
You can do it now.

158
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,240
You're not her.

159
00:07:44,639 --> 00:07:45,160
Impossible.

160
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:46,959
No one can break

161
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:48,079
my concentric illusion.

162
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,199
How did you do it?

163
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:52,040
I recognize

164
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,360
Feng's scent.

165
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,319
What you said

166
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:57,480
is a bit ambiguous.

167
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,040
Your Highness.

168
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:08,839
Lady Feng.

169
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:09,639
Go after her.

170
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,360
I want her alive.

171
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:11,959
Yes, sir.

172
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:16,759
Yue Xuan,

173
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:17,759
