176
00:08:23,079 --> 00:08:24,120
You belong to me,

177
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:26,240
and I will protect you.

178
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:29,480
It's poisonous.

179
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:37,639
Stop right there!

180
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:39,279
Go after her!

181
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,200
Hurry up!

182
00:08:40,399 --> 00:08:40,799
Stop right there!

183
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:48,799
Split up and search!

184
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:49,440
Yes, sir!

185
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:49,879
Yes, sir!

186
00:09:14,279 --> 00:09:15,039
Gu Jiachen,

187
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:21,600
