188
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,399
You've been unconscious for two days.

189
00:09:25,159 --> 00:09:25,720
If you hadn't woken up,

190
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,279
I would have been really worried.

191
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,639
Unconscious for two days?

192
00:09:33,679 --> 00:09:34,840
That day at the Joyful Spring,

193
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,080
