194
00:09:36,879 --> 00:09:37,279
Don't worry.

195
00:09:37,879 --> 00:09:39,000
The royal physician has checked.

196
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,039
The poison on me has been detoxified.

197
00:09:42,039 --> 00:09:43,720
Now you need a good rest.

198
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:45,840
It's gone?

199
00:09:58,679 --> 00:09:59,679
Don't move.

200
00:10:00,159 --> 00:10:01,600
[Since that woman is here to make medicine,]

201
00:10:01,919 --> 00:10:03,039
[the antidote must be]

202
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:03,759
[around here.]

203
00:10:07,559 --> 00:10:08,559
This poison is so powerful.

204
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,440
Thankfully, it didn't hurt you.

205
00:10:13,159 --> 00:10:13,600
Feng Zhiwei,

206
00:10:15,879 --> 00:10:16,360
I'm talking to you.

207
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,840
You... You're like this.

208
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:23,720
Just behave yourself.

209
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:24,480
Have a good rest.

210
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,120
I just saved you.

211
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:29,480
Are you worried about me now?

212
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,559
Or worried about

213
00:10:31,559 --> 00:10:32,600
Gu Jianchen's body?

214
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:34,559
What time is it now?

215
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,519
You're still counting this.

216
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,159
Feng Zhiwei,

217
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,000
I'm dying.

218
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,360
One more kiss,

219
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:42,320
it's not too much, right?

220
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,200
I told you to shut up.

221
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,039
Shut up.

222
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,559
Is that woman's poison

223
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,240
