224
00:11:00,279 --> 00:11:01,639
Save your energy, okay?

225
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:16,000
Well,

226
00:11:16,759 --> 00:11:17,519
how can I understand

227
00:11:17,519 --> 00:11:18,279
the words on it?

228
00:11:22,919 --> 00:11:23,320
So,

229
00:11:24,399 --> 00:11:25,600
you found the antidote

230
00:11:25,639 --> 00:11:26,720
in this book,

231
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,279
and detoxified me.

232
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:31,840
Then why did you faint

233
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,120
when I woke up?

234
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,159
What happened during this period?

235
00:11:56,879 --> 00:11:57,600
I don't remember.

236
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,080
But you're really amazing.

237
00:12:10,759 --> 00:12:11,600
I can't understand

238
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,600
a single word on it.

239
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,919
Your lady is awake.

240
00:12:20,559 --> 00:12:21,240
Yeah.

241
00:12:21,279 --> 00:12:22,720
She's been unconscious for two days.

242
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,919
Fortunately, the doctor has checked her.

243
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:26,200
She's fine.

244
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,080
That's good.

245
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,240
Eunuch Wang told me

246
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,200
that the list

247
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,200
has been submitted.

248
00:12:30,279 --> 00:12:30,919
In three days,

249
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:31,759
I can leave the palace.

250
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,320
That's great.

251
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:34,960
But in the future,

252
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,200
I may not see you again.

253
00:12:36,679 --> 00:12:38,519
The palace has been in turmoil lately,

254
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:40,080
with many maids disappearing.

255
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,000
You must be careful.

256
00:12:41,039 --> 00:12:41,879
Don't worry.

257
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:42,799
I've learned a few moves

258
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:43,399
from Lord Shen.

259
00:12:44,519 --> 00:12:45,799
Even a strong man

260
00:12:46,159 --> 00:12:47,240
can be taken down

261
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,440
with a surprise attack.

262
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,000
That's good.

263
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:49,799
You should go back now.

264
00:12:49,879 --> 00:12:51,279
Your lady is probably looking for you.
